{"id":"909d426f97993ae5","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-dualcomplexity.md","title":"DNF dual recognition is coNP-complete","display":"thm-dualcomplexity — DNF dual recognition is coNP-complete","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-dualcomplexity","aliases":["27-thm-dualcomplexity"],"display":"thm-dualcomplexity — DNF dual recognition is coNP-complete","depends_on":["[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-dualization]]","[[27-df-conpcomplete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-dualcomplexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-dualcomplexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dualcomplexity — DNF dual recognition is coNP-complete"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d89d26f801265a76\" href=\"?note=d89d26f801265a76\" title=\"27-df-dualization\">27-df-dualization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"43077da4ca08cb6c\" href=\"?note=43077da4ca08cb6c\" title=\"27-df-conpcomplete\">27-df-conpcomplete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DUALEQ}\">\\(\\mathrm{DUALEQ}\\)</span> is the language to be defined over the binary alphabet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{encDNF}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pair}\">\\(\\mathrm{pair}\\)</span> are the explicit binary encodings of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DUAL}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DUAL}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coNPC}\">\\(\\mathbf{coNPC}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d89d26f801265a76\" href=\"?note=d89d26f801265a76\" title=\"27-df-dualization\">27-df-dualization</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"43077da4ca08cb6c\" href=\"?note=43077da4ca08cb6c\" title=\"27-df-conpcomplete\">27-df-conpcomplete</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DUALEQ}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{pair}(\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D),\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,E)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land(D,E)\\in\\mathrm{DUAL}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{DUALEQ}\\in\\mathbf{coNPC}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DUALEQ}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{pair}(\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D),\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,E)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land(D,E)\\in\\mathrm{DUAL}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{DUALEQ}\\in\\mathbf{coNPC}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §4.3.1, Theorem 4.26，印刷页 184，PDF 第 208 页（从 1 计数）。 已改为原书实际的 DNF–DNF Dual Recognition，而非旧版本另一个 DNF–CNF 等价问题。membership 由不等价的一个赋值给证书；hardness 用 D=∅（常零），则对偶为常一，询问任意 E 是否恒真，归约 DNF-TAUT。已核对原书该归约；一般 DNF-TAUT 的 coNP 完全性沿用本目录复杂度基础，未在此重证 Cook 定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dualization","status":"resolved","id":"d89d26f801265a76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dualization]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-conpcomplete","status":"resolved","id":"43077da4ca08cb6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-conpcomplete]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encDNF}$ and $\\mathrm{pair}$ are the explicit binary encodings of [[27-df-encoding]]; $\\mathrm{DUAL}_n$ and $\\mathbf{coNPC}$ are defined in [[27-df-dualization]] and [[27-df-conpcomplete]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dualization","status":"resolved","id":"d89d26f801265a76","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encDNF}$ and $\\mathrm{pair}$ are the explicit binary encodings of [[27-df-encoding]]; $\\mathrm{DUAL}_n$ and $\\mathbf{coNPC}$ are defined in [[27-df-dualization]] and [[27-df-conpcomplete]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-conpcomplete","status":"resolved","id":"43077da4ca08cb6c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encDNF}$ and $\\mathrm{pair}$ are the explicit binary encodings of [[27-df-encoding]]; $\\mathrm{DUAL}_n$ and $\\mathbf{coNPC}$ are defined in [[27-df-dualization]] and [[27-df-conpcomplete]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DUALEQ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pair}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DUAL}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coNPC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DUALEQ}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{pair}(\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D),\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,E)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land(D,E)\\in\\mathrm{DUAL}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{DUALEQ}\\in\\mathbf{coNPC}.","display":